  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**((3frac{1)/(4))⁴ -(4(1)/(3))⁴ }{(3(1)/(4))² - (4(1)/(3))²}**\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² - b² = (a - b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nsqrt{((3frac{1)/(4))⁴ -(4(1)/(3))⁴ }{(3(1)/(4))² - (4(1)/(3))²}}\n\n⇒ sqrt{([(3frac{1)/(4))² -(4(1)/(3))²][(3(1)/(4))²+(4(1)/(3))²] }{(3(1)/(4))² - (4(1)/(3))²}}\n\n⇒ sqrt{[(3(1)/(4))²+(4(1)/(3))²] }\n\n⇒ sqrt{[((13)/(4))²+((13)/(3))²] } \n\n⇒ sqrt{[((169)/(16))+((169)/(9))] }\n\n⇒ sqrt{169[((1)/(16))+((1)/(9))] }\n\n⇒ sqrt{169[((9 + 16)/(144))] }\n\n⇒ sqrt{169[((25)/(144))] }\n\n⇒ 13 times (5)/(12)\n\n⇒ (65)/(12)\n\n⇒ 5(5)/(12)\n\n**∴ Square root of ((3frac{1)/(4))⁴ -(4(1)/(3))⁴ }{(3(1)/(4))² - (4(1)/(3))²} is 5(5)/(12).**",
